# Chassis logs

This repository is Bot Chassis. Every change here, including merge and tag, must be written down in the chassis itself.

Required on every commit that changes the frame:

1. Append `.agents/PROJECT_LOG.md`: date, why, commits, files, tests, what was not touched.
2. Append `VERSION_LOG.md` when the stable version or a tag moves: tag, HEAD, previous, why, commits included, consumers (Profiling / psybot).
3. Keep `CHANGELOG.md` in sync with the version you tagged.

Do not skip the logs because tests are green. Do not record chassis history only in `psybot_test`.

Profiling Framework uses tag `profiling` as the hold point. Do not switch Profiling to a new chassis checkout unless the owner says so in this chat.

Do not push, force-push, or retag `profiling` unless the owner asks.
